<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-day T-bill yield steady, long dates up.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-day T-bill yield steady, long dates up.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills was unchanged at 27.96 percent on Tuesday from the previous auction on February 25, a National Bank official said.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills went up to 30.19 percent from 29.73 percent on Feb 25.</p>
<p>The yield on 182-day T-bills rose to 30.23 percent from 25.80 percent on Feb 11.</p>
<p>The yield on 364-day T-bills increased to 30.12 percent from 28.94 percent on Feb 4.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>			  March 4	    Feb 25</p>
<p>    Issue volume     2.00 million lei     3.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations    1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand   2.19 million	   1.91 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold	2.00 million	   1.20 million</p>
<p>    Yield	     27.96 pct	  27.96 pct</p>
<p>    Price	     97.9 pct	   97.9 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids   97.9-98.7 pct    97.9-98.7 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity	  April 3, 1997    March 27, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>			  March 4	    Feb 25</p>
<p>    Issue volume    28.00 million lei    24.00 million</p>
<p>    Denominations    1,000 lei	  1,000</p>
<p>    Nominal demand  27.66 million	  30.90 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold     26.10 million	  24.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield	     30.19 pct	  29.73 pct</p>
<p>    Price	     93.0 pct	   93.1 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids   93.0-94.5 pct    93.1-95.0 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity	  June 5, 1997     May 29, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 182-day paper auction:</p>
<p>			  March 4	    Feb 11</p>
<p>    Issue volume     7.00 million lei     3.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations    1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand   2.48 million	   13.00 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold	1.60 million	   3.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield	     30.23 pct	  25.80 pct</p>
<p>    Price	     86.9 pct	   88.6 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids   86.9-91.0 pct    88.6-90.2 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity	  Sept 4, 1997     Aug 14, 1998</p>
